* Bench detector and gate-permission circuit. Logic rail 3.3 V.
* IPRI is a primary-current stimulus with a scale of 1 V/A.
* PRI_OK and SEC_OK represent supervised external bias domains.
.subckt BENCH_PROTECT IPRI PRI_OK SEC_OK ARM RUN ENP ENS VSENSE
Vlogic vdd 0 3.3
R13 vdd hi 12.4k
R14 hi mid 4.02k
R15 mid lo 4.02k
R16 lo 0 12.4k
C7 mid 0 100n
* Secondary-referred CT model. Minimum Lm, maximum winding resistance.
Bct mid core I={v(IPRI)/100}
Lct core mid 1.33m
Rw core out 10.68
R11 out mid 10
R12 out VSENSE 1k
Cin VSENSE 0 5p
* Comparator and isolator delays below are illustrative RC equivalents.
Bhi hcmd 0 V={3.3*(v(VSENSE)<v(hi))}
Blo lcmd 0 V={3.3*(v(VSENSE)>v(lo))}
Rh hcmd hok 1k
Ch hok 0 58p
Rl lcmd lok 1k
Cl lok 0 58p
Riso1 SEC_OK sec_ok_p 1k
Ciso1 sec_ok_p 0 18p
Bwindow wok 0 V={3.3*(v(hok)>1.65 && v(lok)>1.65)}
Brails rok 0 V={3.3*(v(PRI_OK)>1.65 && v(sec_ok_p)>1.65)}
Breset reset 0 V={3.3*(v(wok)<1.65 || v(rok)<1.65)}
Bdata data 0 V={3.3*(v(RUN)<1.65)}
Ain [data ARM reset] [dd dc dr] prot_adc
.model prot_adc adc_bridge(in_low=1.5 in_high=1.8)
Aff dd dc NULL dr dq NULL prot_ff
.model prot_ff d_dff(ic=0 clk_delay=5n reset_delay=5n)
Aq [dq] [q] prot_dac
.model prot_dac dac_bridge(out_low=0 out_high=3.3 out_undef=0 t_rise=2n t_fall=2n)
Bpermit ENP 0 V={3.3*(v(q)>1.65 && v(RUN)>1.65)}
Riso2 ENP ENS 1k
Ciso2 ENS 0 18p
.ends BENCH_PROTECT
